                </p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d99-f3" n="7" xml:id="d99-f3-content">
                <p>Carlos Martins, Brazilian Ambassador to the United States.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d99-f4" n="8" xml:id="d99-f4-content">
                <p>Ambassador Berle, in telegram 2875, September 13, 1945, 7 p.m., reported that the
                    Brazilian Government approved (710 Consultation 4/9–1345).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
